  "reviews": [
    {
      "game": "Crimson Desert Enhanced Deluxe Edition",
      "game_image": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/products/21082/450x258/crimson-desert-enhanced-deluxe-edition-pc-mac-steam-cover.jpg?v=1790827200",
      "game_url": "https://www.instant-gaming.com/en/21082-buy-crimson-desert-enhanced-deluxe-edition-pc-mac-steam/",
      "user": "Silverfang",
      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/avatars/6287100-1549204039.jpg",
      "sentiment": "like",
      "content": "Lots of things to do with huge exploration. \n\n\n\nDont like walking ? Glide around map. Geta horse . Horse feels slow ? Go to Delesya , steal dragon egg, hatch it , feed it, ride a dragon. HMMMMM not good enough, go back to Delesya , tame HUGE dragon . \n\n\n\nJust scratching the surface"
    },
    {
      "game": "CONTROL Resonant",
      "game_image": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/products/13170/450x258/control-resonant-pc-steam-cover.jpg?v=1790827200",
      "game_url": "https://www.instant-gaming.com/en/13170-buy-control-resonant-pc-steam/",
      "user": "oonsaippua",
      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/avatars/19109285-1711126175.jpg",
      "sentiment": "like",
      "content": "Still haven't finished the game, but I can confidently say it's got everything you want from Remedy. It's weird, innovative, and the gameplay is fun too. It is hard, but I didn't find it frustrating, which is great."
    },
    {
      "game": "The Blood of Dawnwalker",
      "game_image": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/products/22485/450x258/the-blood-of-dawnwalker-pc-steam-cover.jpg?v=1790827200",
      "game_url": "https://www.instant-gaming.com/en/22485-buy-the-blood-of-dawnwalker-pc-steam/",
      "user": "undeadlion94",
      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/avatars/23991157-1728164854.jpg",
      "sentiment": "like",
      "content": "I enjoyed my time with my first play through; I finished the game with 10days left on the timer. I think 30 days is perfect and I will go back and spend more time on 2 deep quests that introduced a major story element that I missed. The skill tree and character progression from night and day is a cool idea of having them change based on time. The boss battles and puzzles are really fun and good enough of a challenge."
    },
    {
      "game": "The Blood of Dawnwalker Eclipse Edition",
      "game_image": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/products/22489/450x258/the-blood-of-dawnwalker-eclipse-edition-pc-steam-cover.jpg?v=1790827200",
      "game_url": "https://www.instant-gaming.com/en/22489-buy-the-blood-of-dawnwalker-eclipse-edition-pc-steam/",
      "user": "YaBoiLuckus",
      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/avatars/12271979-1655578601.jpg",
      "sentiment": "like",
      "content": "Absolute Banger;\n\n\n\nI was worried about the combat cause my only concept of directional attacking and blocking is For Honor and I only ever hear about how frustrating that game is BUT this shit is elite. Way easier than For Honor combat even on the highest difficulty preset where it doesn’t display what direction to block in the movements are done very well so you can block or even parry the attacks without too much difficulty. \n\n\n\nAlso Story is great and you have a lot of freedom in how you want to play and the dialogue options are accurate. Won’t trick you with a “no” that actually ends up being like “no and I hate you and your mother and I’m gonna kill you” \n\n\n\nThe 30 day timer isn’t even much of an issue. Gives you a sense of urgency and kinda leads you to doing various quests be it night or day which is a nice gimmick to help it stand out. First playthrough I had like 3 days left but I’d done everything I wanted to do in that playthrough. Now with more knowledge on my second run managing the time is pretty easy.\n\n\n\n100% 1000% this is worth playing."
    }
  ],
